jobs.description:
We are looking for motivated Production Workers to join us!
You will be joining a team at a small, specialized company in the Deinze regio.

Do you have technical insight, enjoy working with your hands, and are you looking for a varied job in production? Then this job opening might be just the thing for you!

What are your tasks?

• You are responsible for blasting steel parts.
• You perform electroplating on parts.
• You assist in handling and moving various items.
• You operate an overhead crane and/or forklift.
• You ensure that your work is performed correctly and safely.
• You will contribute to various tasks within production. Variety in tasks and versatility are important in this role.

Who are you?

• You have technical insight and know how to solve problems quickly;
• You speak English well (understanding instructions, communicating with colleagues without any problems);
• You are versatile: you are not scared to be a bit more flexible in your job;
• You have a first experience with blasting steel parts;
• A first experience with metallising is a plus;
• A forklift certificate or crane operator certificate is a plus; 
• You are able to work independently and hard-working.
